<title>USA: Capsure says in talks on possible merger.</title>
<headline>Capsure says in talks on possible merger.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Capsure Holdings Corp said Tuesday it is in preliminary discussions on a possible stock merger of the company with a third party whom it did not identify.</p>
<p>It said such a transaction has not been presented to the Capsure board for approval, and there is no assurance a definitive agreement will be reached.</p>
<p>Capsure provides surety and fidelity bonds in all 50 states through a combined network of 120,000 independent agents.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
